    },
    {
      "rubric_id": "R3",
      "class": "decision-now",
      "severity": "non-blocking",
      "affected_surface": "P1c band field 'stalled K'; P1a runs --json field list",
      "claim": "The band shows a 'stalled K' count but no P1a field produces it; the only stall notion in the plan is P3 liveness.stall (report-only), which lands after P1c. A datum without a stated source violates section 2.5's per-datum source rule and risks being derived from the process monitor.",
      "evidence": "P1c band string: 'running N · oldest HH:MM · stalled K · last rc ...'. P1a new columns: elapsed_s, rc, final_status, project, source, fact_at, observed_at, probe_age_s, alive — no stalled. P3 source list includes liveness.stall (report-only).",
      "evidence_reference": "plan section 4 P1c band bullet; section 4 P1a runs --json bullet; section 4 P3 來源 list",
      "repair": "Either drop 'stalled' from the P1c band until P3, or define it in P1a as a pure execution-axis telemetry value (for example probe_age_s greater than 2 ticks or no manifest change for N seconds) with its source and as_of, and add it to status-runs-fields.test.sh. Label it as execution state in references/review-page.md.",
      "blocks_next_slice_or_immediate_integrity": false,
