    },
    {
      "rubric_id": "R3",
      "class": "decision-now",
      "severity": "non-blocking",
      "affected_surface": "P1b gate result table candidate matching (舊候選 / CONFLICT)",
      "claim": "Review receipts are labelled 舊候選 when their chain head does not match the job's candidate_commit, but candidate_commit comes from task_status_receipt; when no task receipt exists yet (the common mid-round state), the comparison has no reference and the plan does not say what label applies, so an implementation could either hide live gate results or mislabel them as stale.",
      "evidence": "Section 2.7 candidate row: 'receipt 顯示前必須與 job 的 candidate 相符，否則標「舊候選」' with source task_status_receipt. P1b ②: no receipt → fixed sentence; gate table ⑦ defines 舊候選 and CONFLICT only.",
      "evidence_reference": "plan section 2.7 candidate row; section 4 P1b 版型 items ② and ⑦",
      "repair": "Add a third label in the chip mapping: when no task_status_receipt exists, show the review receipt with candidate 'unverified' (head sha displayed) rather than 舊候選, and add a negative control to render-review-page.test.sh: PASS review receipt with no task receipt → row present, chip unverified, conclusion sentence still the fixed no-verdict sentence.",
