    {
      "rubric_id": "R4",
      "class": "decision-now",
      "severity": "non-blocking",
      "affected_surface": "P0 S2 scope; P1c band cost and context sources",
      "claim": "S2 verifies the mod data path only for the runs-live envelope and its SSD fallback, but P1c also reads ~/.claude/metrics/costs.jsonl, <live-base>/context/<sid>.json and the session-mode marker, and needs its own session id to filter costs. Whether $.fs.read can reach the home directory and how the mod learns its sid are unverified, so P1c silently depends on unverified claims.",
      "evidence": "S2 row: '$.fs.read 讀 <live-base>/runs/<scope>.json ... 與 SSD 退路 ~/.autopilot/review/<project_key>/live/runs.json'. P1c band: 'cost 讀 ~/.claude/metrics/costs.jsonl 依 session 與日期加總、context 讀 <live-base>/context/<sid>.json ... 按 sid 取'. No spike covers these paths or the sid source.",
      "evidence_reference": "plan section 4 P0 S2 row; section 4 P1c band bullet",
      "repair": "Extend S2 to read all four paths (runs envelope, costs.jsonl, context/<sid>.json, session-mode marker) from both terminal and desktop and record the API member that yields the session id; if any path is unreadable, P1c must show '—' for that datum and the plan should say so.",
